Z||000004||terryk||07-03-2001||07:58 PM||||The people that are up in arms need to stop responding to the posts (just like I am??!). There will always be people flaming, people mis-understanding, people calling a spade a spade and on and on. There's no way it can be stopped but we can certainly stop encouraging the behavour by IGNORING it.<BR>What goes on outside the forum can't be controlled. What goes on inside can. <P>I will be lucky to meet 1 out of the 1000+ people that have floated through here. What people say in the end is irrelevant to my life and those that feel flamed should come to grips with the same.<P>And now back to the Rubbermaid cup holder thread already in progress.......<P>||||reg||1
