Z||000006||btoth||07-04-2001||03:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrgone:<BR><B>i was just about to post suggesting a voting system. <P>great minds think alike<P>good idea</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I know that the MR2 board has a simple hyperlink that says "Report thread to moderator" in small text... not in the way at all and would probably be really easy to do.  Then, intead of a bunch of people responding to an offensive thread, they could just click the link and have it removed.||||reg||1
